{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47305","headline":"步虚词十首 四 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禀化凝正气，链形爲真仙。\n忘心符元宗，返本协自然。\n帝一集绦宫，流光出丹玄。\n元英与桃君，朗咏长生篇。\n六府焕明霞，百关罗紫烟。\n飙车涉寥廓，靡靡乘景迁。\n不觉云路远，斯须游万天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}